    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>“Some things you carry around because you haven’t figured out where to put them yet.”</em></p><p><strong>Magma Memory (1/Soma Break).</strong> As a reaction when you take energy damage (any flavor) from a single source, you may bank a portion of the heat. Until your next Soma Break, you may spend the banked heat as a bonus action to add <strong>+2d10 exploding energy damage (flavor: fire)</strong> to your next weapon attack or unarmed strike that hits. The banked heat also warms you: while it is held, you have advantage on Body checks against environmental cold.</p>",
